          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range}&=15-11\\\\\\text{Range}&=4\\end{align*}$$\n\n$15$ occurs three times, more often than any other score. The mode is $15$.\n\nThere are $10$ scores.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{(2\\times11)+(1\\times12)+(2\\times13)+(2\\times14)+(3\\times15)}{10}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{133}{10}\\\\\\bar{x}&=13.3\\end{align*}$$\n\n$M_p=\\frac{10+1}{2}=5.5$, so use positions $5$ and $6$. Counting in ascending order, the 5th score is $13$ and the 6th score is $14$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{13+14}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=13.5\\end{align*}$$",
