          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range}&=4-(-4)\\\\\\text{Range}&=8\\end{align*}$$\n\n$-2$ occurs nine times, more often than any other score. The mode is $-2$.\n\nThere are $38$ scores.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{\\begin{gathered}(3\\times(-4))+(6\\times(-3))+(9\\times(-2))+(8\\times(-1))\\\\{}+(6\\times0)+(3\\times1)+(2\\times2)+(0\\times3)+(1\\times4)\\end{gathered}}{38}\\\\\\bar{x}&=-\\frac{45}{38}\\\\\\bar{x}&\\approx-1.18\\end{align*}$$\n\n$M_p=\\frac{38+1}{2}=19.5$, so use positions $19$ and $20$. Counting in ascending order, the 19th and 20th scores are both $-1$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{(-1)+(-1)}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=-1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 56
      }
